11. WHAT THIS PROVES

Enterprise-style external source responses can be represented as read-only observations. Clean connector output still does not become trusted evidence.

Stale connector output is blocked or quarantined. Adversarial escalation attempts are blocked, and unknown connector laundering is quarantined and blocked.

This establishes the observation boundary needed before External Evidence Acceptance Gate v0.1.

12. WHAT THIS DOES NOT PROVE

It does not implement real connector/API access, call network or Gemini, or implement External Evidence Acceptance Gate.

It does not accept evidence, prove truth, create ready status, write DRS, execute action, install a Needle, implement External DRS, grant production autonomy, or invoke Marennya or UP.

